{
  "$comment": "Foreground/background token pairs the Keryx components rely on, checked in both themes by scripts/check_contrast.py. 4.5:1 is WCAG 2.2 AA for normal text (1.4.3); 3:1 is AA for large text, control edges, meaningful icons, chart marks and focus indicators (1.4.11, 2.4.11). A pair with min 1 is decorative and says why.",
